# Analyze Accessibility

## File Purpose and Relationship

This file defines the process for analyzing accessibility aspects of React components and applications within the front-end workflow. It should be consulted when:

- Identifying accessibility issues in components or pages
- Evaluating WCAG compliance
- Ensuring proper semantic HTML structure
- Verifying keyboard navigation and focus management
- Checking for proper ARIA attributes
- Assessing color contrast and text legibility
- Ensuring screen reader compatibility

This file complements:
- **analyze-component.md**: General component structure analysis
- **analyze-performance.md**: Performance analysis
- **component-validation.md**: Component validation
- **verify-implementation.md**: Implementation verification

## Usage as Project-Rule-Parameter

This file contains the accessibility analysis process and should be referenced as a project-rule-parameter when comprehensive accessibility analysis is needed:

```
analyze-accessibility: front-end/src/components/ComponentName.tsx @parameters/front-end/helpers/analysis/analyze-accessibility.mdc
```

## Command Format

```
analyze-accessibility: [component-or-directory-path] @parameters/front-end/helpers/analysis/analyze-accessibility.mdc
```

## Required Context

To perform accessibility analysis, the following context is required:

1. Access to the component or application source code
2. Understanding of WCAG accessibility standards
3. Knowledge of React accessibility best practices
4. Understanding of semantic HTML and ARIA roles

## Process Steps

### 1. Semantic HTML Analysis

Analyze the usage of semantic HTML:

```typescript
// Read the component file
read_file("front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx", should_read_entire_file=true)

// Check for semantic HTML elements
grep_search("<(header|main|footer|nav|section|article|aside|figure|figcaption|time|mark|details|summary)[ >]", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for heading structure
grep_search("<h[1-6][ >]", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for list structures
grep_search("<(ul|ol)[ >]|<li[ >]", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for improper div usage
grep_search("<div[^>]*onClick=|<div[^>]*onKeyDown=|<div[^>]*role=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
```

### 2. ARIA Attributes Analysis

Analyze the usage of ARIA attributes:

```typescript
// Check for ARIA roles
grep_search("role=[\"'][a-z-]+[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for ARIA attributes
grep_search("aria-[a-z]+=[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for aria-label on interactive elements
grep_search("<(button|a|input|select|textarea)[^>]*aria-label=|<(button|a|input|select|textarea)[^>]*aria-labelledby=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for aria-describedby
grep_search("aria-describedby=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for aria-hidden
grep_search("aria-hidden=[\"']true[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
```

### 3. Keyboard Navigation Analysis

Analyze keyboard navigation support:

```typescript
// Check for keyboard event handlers
grep_search("onKeyDown=|onKeyUp=|onKeyPress=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for tab index
grep_search("tabIndex=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for proper focus management
grep_search("useRef<HTML[A-Za-z]+Element>|createRef<HTML[A-Za-z]+Element>|React\\.useRef<HTML[A-Za-z]+Element>", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
grep_search("\\.current\\.focus\\(\\)", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for focus trapping in modals
grep_search("FocusTrap|focus-trap|useFocusTrap", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")
```

### 4. Form Accessibility Analysis

Analyze form accessibility:

```typescript
// Check for label usage
grep_search("<label[^>]*htmlFor=|<Label[^>]*htmlFor=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for input-label associations
grep_search("<input[^>]*id=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for form validation messaging
grep_search("aria-invalid=|aria-errormessage=|aria-describedby=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for required field indicators
grep_search("aria-required=|required=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
```

### 5. Image and Media Accessibility Analysis

Analyze image and media accessibility:

```typescript
// Check for alt text on images
grep_search("<img[^>]*alt=|<Image[^>]*alt=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for empty alt text on decorative images
grep_search("<img[^>]*alt=[\"\'][\"']|<Image[^>]*alt=[\"\'][\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for captions in video content
grep_search("<video[^>]*>.*<track[^>]*kind=[\"']captions[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for transcript links
grep_search("transcript|aria-describedby=[\"'][a-zA-Z0-9_-]+[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
```

### 6. Color Contrast and Text Analysis

Analyze color contrast and text presentation:

```typescript
// Check for color style definitions
grep_search("color:|background-color:|backgroundColor:|color:", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for font size definitions
grep_search("font-size:|fontSize:", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for theme usage with potential contrast issues
grep_search("theme\\.[a-zA-Z0-9_.]+", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for responsive text sizes
grep_search("(xs|sm|md|lg|xl):[a-zA-Z0-9_.]+", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")
```

### 7. Screen Reader Compatibility Analysis

Analyze screen reader compatibility:

```typescript
// Check for visually hidden text
grep_search("visually-hidden|visuallyHidden|sr-only|srOnly|VisuallyHidden", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")

// Check for aria-live regions
grep_search("aria-live=", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")

// Check for status announcements
grep_search("aria-busy=|aria-atomic=|aria-relevant=", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")

// Check for expandable content accessibility
grep_search("aria-expanded=|aria-controls=", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")
```

### 8. Dynamic Content Accessibility Analysis

Analyze accessibility of dynamic content:

```typescript
// Check for loading states
grep_search("isLoading|loading|aria-busy=|aria-live=|Skeleton|placeholder|Shimmer", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for error handling with accessibility
grep_search("isError|error|aria-invalid=|aria-errormessage=", false, "front-end/src/components/ExampleComponent.tsx")

// Check for notification mechanisms
grep_search("toast|notification|alert|aria-live=", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")

// Check for modal accessibility
grep_search("Modal|Dialog|role=[\"']dialog[\"']|role=[\"']alertdialog[\"']", false, "front-end/src/components/**/*.tsx")
```

## Expected Outputs

The accessibility analysis should produce:

1. An accessibility analysis report identifying issues and compliance gaps
2. A prioritized list of accessibility issues to address
3. Recommendations for accessibility improvements
4. WCAG compliance assessment

## Accessibility Issue Categories

| Category | Description | Common Causes | Improvement Strategies |
|----------|-------------|--------------|-------------------------|
| **Semantic HTML** | Improper HTML structure | Using div for interactive elements, misusing headings | Use proper semantic elements, follow heading hierarchy |
| **ARIA Attributes** | Missing or improper ARIA usage | Lack of labels, incorrect roles, missing descriptions | Add appropriate aria-* attributes, use correct roles |
| **Keyboard Navigation** | Poor keyboard support | Missing focus management, no keyboard handlers, improper tabIndex | Add keyboard event handlers, manage focus correctly |
| **Form Accessibility** | Inaccessible forms | Missing labels, poor error feedback, unlabeled required fields | Add labels, proper error messages, field requirements |
| **Image/Media** | Inaccessible images or media | Missing alt text, no captions, autoplay | Add alt text, captions, and controls |
| **Color and Text** | Contrast and legibility issues | Poor color contrast, small text, fixed sizes | Use accessible colors, proper font sizes, responsive text |
| **Screen Reader** | Screen reader incompatibility | No text alternatives, improper announcements | Add aria-live regions, status announcements |
| **Dynamic Content** | Inaccessible dynamic changes | No announcements, poor focus management | Add live regions, manage focus on content changes |

